{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15290","headline":"胡腾儿 · 李端","name":"胡腾儿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"胡腾身是凉州儿，肌肤如玉鼻如锥。\n桐布轻衫前後卷，葡萄长带一边垂。\n帐前跪作本音语，拾襟搅袖爲君舞。\n安西旧牧收泪看，洛下词人抄曲与。\n扬眉动目踏花毡，红汗交流珠帽偏。\n醉却东倾又西倒，双靴柔弱满灯前。\n环行急蹴皆应节，反手叉腰如却月。\n丝桐忽奏一曲终，呜呜画角城头发。\n胡腾儿，胡腾儿，故乡路断知不知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15290.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15290","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}